    <questiontext format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Question ID:</strong> ENG2_U06_L02_Q01</p><p><strong>MLA Standard:</strong> MLA.ENG2.C.01</p><p>Which oral outline order is strongest?</p>]]></text></questiontext>
    <generalfeedback format="html"><text></text></generalfeedback>
    <defaultgrade>1.0000000</defaultgrade>
    <penalty>0.3333333</penalty>
    <hidden>0</hidden>
    <idnumber>ENG2_U06_L02_Q01</idnumber>
    <single>true</single>
    <shuffleanswers>true</shuffleanswers>
    <answernumbering>none</answernumbering>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>Closing, evidence, random fact, opening, claim.</p>]]></text>
